        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This act may be cited as the Statutory and local authorities Pensions (amendment)(No. 2) act 2008."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 2(a), section 3, paragraphs 4(a) and 5(a), section 8 and subsections 9(1), (2) and (3) come into operation on 1 January 2009."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 2(b), section 7 and subsection 9(4) are deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2008."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The amendments in paragraphs 4(b) and 5(b) and section 6, in so far as they relate to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the reduction of the amount of the derivative pension to seventy per cent after the period of twelve and a half years, come into operation on 1 January 2009; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the requirement of residency in Malaysia, are deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2008. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Statutory and local authorities Pensions act 1980 [Act 239], which is referred to as “the principal act” in this act, is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of “pensionable employee”, by inserting before the words “section 7” the words “subsection 6a(6c) or”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the definition of “resident in Malaysia”. Amendment of section 6a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 6a of the principal act is amended by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsections: “(6a) Notwithstanding subsection (3), an employee who had opted for the Employees Provident Fund Scheme before 1 January 2009 and has been confirmed in his appointment before such date shall be given an option to opt for pension, gratuity or other benefit granted under this act. (6b) The option made under subsection (6a) shall be irrevocable on 1 February 2009 and the provisions of this act shall apply to the employee from that date. (6c) Where an employee has opted for pension, gratuity or other benefit pursuant to subsection (6a) and dies before the option becomes irrevocable pursuant to subsection (6b), the employee is deemed to be a pensionable employee and the provisions of this act shall apply to him from the date of his death.”. Amendment of section 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 12 of the principal act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4), by substituting for the words “Where an employee” the words “Subject to section 17, where an employee”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (5). (Amendment)(No. 2) Amendment of section 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 15 of the principal act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words “Where a pensionable employee” the words “Subject to section 17, where a pensionable employee”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsection (2). Amendment of section 16"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 16(1) of the principal act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (a);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (b)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “employee dies” the words “within or”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “seventy per centum of the employee’s pension” the words “the amount of pension paid to him”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the proviso— Deletion of section 16a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (iv), by substituting for the comma at the end of the paragraph a full stop; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words “and is resident in Malaysia.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal act is amended by deleting section 16a. Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 24 of the principal act is amended by substituting for the word “one-half” the words “three-fifths”. Savings and transitional provisions"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any employee who has opted for the Employees Provident Fund Scheme before 1 January 2009 but the confirmation of his appointment has been backdated to before 1 January 2009, the employee shall be given an option to opt for pension, gratuity or other benefit as specified in subsection 6a(6a) of the principal act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), the option of the employee shall be deemed irrevocable one month from the date he exercises the option and the provisions of the principal act shall apply to the employee from that date."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The grant of pension or derivative pension in respect of any employee who retires before 1 January 2009 or dies before 31 December 2008 shall be based on the principal act as if it has not been amended by this act and such grant of pension or derivative pension shall be based on the amendments made to the principal act by this act only from 1 January 2009 and shall be payable from that date."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/23/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of the abolishment of the requirement of residency in Malaysia, the grant of derivative pension before 1 January 2008 shall be based on the principal act as if it has not been amended by this act and such grant of derivative pension shall be based on the amendments made to the principal act by this act only from 1 January 2008 and shall be payable from that date."
      }
    }
  ]
}
